@TrainingCoursesSystem.Server_HostAddress = https://localhost:7177

### Check backend and database status
GET {{TrainingCoursesSystem.Server_HostAddress}}/api/system/status
Accept: application/json

### Quick database test
GET {{TrainingCoursesSystem.Server_HostAddress}}/api/test/db
Accept: application/json

### Public course list
GET {{TrainingCoursesSystem.Server_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Accept: application/json